his version adds any proxy-based (non-ASPECTJ-mode) AOP path — e.g. testing @EnableCaching/@EnableTransactionManagement/@EnableAsync without mode=ASPECTJ, or any CGLIB-backed proxy creation — mirror the precedent from tests/src/org.springframework/spring-context/6.0.0/build.gradle and tests/src/org.springframework/spring-aop/6.0.0/build.gradle: set system property spring.objenesis.ignore=true for the Test tasks and nativeTest runtimeArgs, add the matching graalvmNative binaries.test buildArgs entry, and add the generatePredefinedCglibProxyClasses JavaExec step wired into nativeTestCompile/nativeTraceImage. Otherwise no extra setup is expected beyond a straight version bump of the existing 5.3.31 scaffold.\",\n  \"risks\": [\"Issue's failure log is truncated before the actual failing assertion, so the true root cause of the native-image run failure is unverified beyond this setup analysis.\"]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":5708,"type":"result","duration_ms":120773,"uuid":"80855af8-e690-418d-9ab3-ceadbd42f6b7","ttft_stream_ms":1329,"time_to_request_ms":86,"first_content_frame_ms":1329,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

